## Security Features

- **Password Hashing**: BCrypt with salt for all user types
- **JWT Authentication**: Secure token-based authentication
- **Role-Based Authorization**: Different access levels per user type
- **Account Status**: Active/inactive account management
- **User Context Validation**: Users can only access their own data
- **Token Claims**: NIC stored in JWT for EV owners

## API Endpoints Summary

### Authentication
- `POST /api/auth/register` - Create system users (Backoffice only)
- `POST /api/auth/login` - System user login
- `POST /api/evownerauth/register` - EV owner registration
- `POST /api/evownerauth/login` - EV owner login
- `GET /api/evownerauth/profile` - Get EV owner profile
- `PUT /api/evownerauth/profile` - Update EV owner profile

### Charging Stations
- `POST /api/chargingstations` - Create station (Backoffice)
- `GET /api/chargingstations` - List all stations (Public)
- `GET /api/chargingstations/active` - List active stations (Public)
- `GET /api/chargingstations/{id}` - Get station details (Public)
- `PUT /api/chargingstations/{id}` - Update station (Backoffice + Operator)
- `DELETE /api/chargingstations/{id}` - Deactivate station (Backoffice)

### Bookings
- `POST /api/bookings` - Create booking (EV Owner)
- `GET /api/bookings/my-bookings` - Get own bookings (EV Owner)
- `PUT /api/bookings/{id}` - Update booking (EV Owner)
- `DELETE /api/bookings/{id}` - Cancel booking (EV Owner)
- `GET /api/bookings` - All bookings (Backoffice)
- `GET /api/bookings/{id}` - Specific booking (Backoffice + Operator)

### EV Owner Management (Backoffice)
- `POST /api/evowners` - Create EV owner profile
- `PUT /api/evowners/{nic}` - Update EV owner profile
- `DELETE /api/evowners/{nic}` - Delete EV owner
- `POST /api/evowners/{nic}/activate` - Activate account
- `POST /api/evowners/{nic}/deactivate` - Deactivate account

## Database Schema

### Collections
- **Users**: System users (Backoffice, Station Operators)
- **EVOwners**: EV owner profiles with authentication
- **ChargingStations**: Charging station details
- **Bookings**: Reservation records

### Key Relationships
- Bookings link to EVOwners via NIC
- Bookings link to ChargingStations via ID
- User roles determine access permissions

